        "150840102": {
          "id": 150840102,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "你還記得之前我留給你觀賽門票的事嗎？",
          "next": [
            150840103
          ]
        },
        "150840103": {
          "id": 150840103,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "原本是希望你能享受演出的，沒想到，你成為了演出的一部分",
          "next": [
            150840104,
            150840105
          ]
        },
        "150840104": {
          "id": 150840104,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "沒有看成演出是挺可惜的，能不能有下次演出的票呢？",
          "next": [
            150840106
          ]
        },
        "150840105": {
          "id": 150840105,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "實不相瞞，回去之後我一直在搜開幕演出的錄播影片",
          "next": [
            150840106
          ]
        },
        "150840106": {
          "id": 150840106,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "畢竟你當時是坐在賽車裡，還是用TR的糟糕音質聽到的新歌",
          "next": [
            150840107
          ]
        },
        "150840107": {
          "id": 150840107,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "怪不好意思的",
          "next": [
            150840108
          ]
        },
        "150840108": {
          "id": 150840108,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "所以",
          "next": [
            150840109
          ]
        },
        "150840109": {
          "id": 150840109,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "我為你準備了一個特別位置，能夠感受我的現場演出，怎麼樣？",
          "next": [
            150840110
          ]
        },
        "150840110": {
          "id": 150840110,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "太棒了，那麼在哪裡能看到呢？",
          "next": [
            150840111
          ]
        },
        "150840111": {
          "id": 150840111,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "我和星際和平娛樂有個合作計畫，目標是「重現現場的感動」",
          "next": [
            150840112
          ]
        },
        "150840112": {
          "id": 150840112,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "任何人都可以在千星城的海濱公園的舞台上反覆觀看知更鳥的現場演出",
          "next": [
            150840113
          ]
        },
        "150840113": {
          "id": 150840113,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "如果你感興趣的話，就去海濱公園的吧台找一個名叫「洛可」的酒保",
          "next": [
            150840114
          ]
        },
        "150840114": {
          "id": 150840114,
          "type": "Image",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "image": "PhoneMessagePic_15501",
          "next": [
            150840115
          ]
        },
        "150840115": {
          "id": 150840115,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "我提前給他們打好招呼了",
          "next": [
            150840116
          ]
        },
        "150840116": {
          "id": 150840116,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "你會是這個「特殊演出」的第一位觀眾",
